735200101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1055,"speakerName":"ドリー","textMapHash":3143880690,"text":"お二人は、私から情報を購入すると決めたんですの？","nextNodeIds":[735200102]},{"nodeId":735200102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":253302714,"text":"うーん…おまえのいう独占情報には、確かに興味あるけど…先に値段を教えてくれ！高すぎた買わないぞ。","nextNodeIds":[735200103]},{"nodeId":735200103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1055,"speakerName":"ドリー","textMapHash":151783346,"text":"百万モラですの、値段交渉は受け付けませんわ！","nextNodeIds":[735200104]},{"nodeId":735200104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1559274794,"text":"たかっ！やっぱやめよう！百万モラがあれば、美味しいものがたくさん買えるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[735200105]},{"nodeId":735200105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1055,"speakerName":"ドリー","textMapHash":4145799762,"text":"少々お待ちくださいまし。どれどれ…なんと！？パイモンは本日の千一番目のお客様ですわ。もとは百万モラの価値がある特別情報ですが、なんと無料で差し上げちゃいますの！","nextNodeIds":[735200106]},{"nodeId":735200106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":198592538,"text":"えっ！？そんなうまい話があるのか！？","nextNodeIds":[735200107]},{"nodeId":735200107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2198225682,"text":"待て。まさか罠とかじゃないよな？無料とか言っといて、話していくうちに有料に…","nextNodeIds":[735200108]},{"nodeId":735200108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1055,"speakerName":"ドリー","textMapHash":696574402,"text":"なーら結構ですわ。お次のお客様、どうぞ——","nextNodeIds":[735200109]},{"nodeId":735200109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1879870786,"text":"いやいやいや。悪かったよ。ちゃんと聞くから！","nextNodeIds":[735200110]},{"nodeId":735200110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1055,"speakerName":"ドリー","textMapHash":743183410,"text":"ドリーの独占情報その一！あなたたちは、才識の冠のことを覚えていますこと？","nextNodeIds":[735200111]},{"nodeId":735200111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3328519330,"text":"もちろんだぜ。チャンピオンだけが戴く資格がある冠で、なんだかすごく高そうなものらしいぞ！","nextNodeIds":[735200112]},{"nodeId":735200112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1055,"speakerName":"ドリー","textMapHash":3022844466,"text":"その通りですわ。サーチェンが教令院に寄付したのは、とても貴重な骨董品だったんですの。","nextNodeIds":[735200113]},{"nodeId":735200113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1055,"speakerName":"ドリー","textMapHash":1687646298,"text":"それにあの冠は教令院に寄付された後、一度紛失されたことがあったらしいですわよ！","nextNodeIds":[735200114]},{"nodeId":735200114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":363141282,"text":"へえ？オイラたち、そんなの聞いたことないけどな？","nextNodeIds":[735200115]},{"nodeId":735200115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1055,"speakerName":"ドリー","textMapHash":3600343282,"text":"うふふっ…誰でも知っていたら、「独占情報」にならないですわ。","nextNodeIds":[735200116]},{"nodeId":735200116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1055,"speakerName":"ドリー","textMapHash":466449202,"text":"もちろん、この情報はでたらめなんかじゃありませんわよ。ちゃんとした証人がいますの。","nextNodeIds":[735200117]},{"nodeId":735200117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1055,"speakerName":"ドリー","textMapHash":383312378,"text":"南の郊外に、カシュミールという若者がいますわ。興味があるのでしたら、彼に聞いてみるといいですわよ。","nextNodeIds":[735200118]},{"nodeId":735200118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1055,"speakerName":"ドリー","textMapHash":801183074,"text":"合言葉は…「二十年前の出来事」ですの！","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7352001,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1055"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7352002,"order":2,"stepDescription":"カシュミールと会話する","stepDescTextMapHash":235315140,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCA